-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ח/5: עדכון הצמדה למדד של תוספת שקלית 2016
-- The 2016 shekel supplement's linkage to the consumer price index: the
-- linked monthly amounts from 1.1.2018 and from 1.6.2018, for teachers in
-- the Oz LeTmura reform and for those outside it and principals.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר תשע"ח/5 הצמדת תוספת שקלית 2016`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 akn:hc_1/p12 The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:hc_1/p13 akn:hc_1/p14 akn:hc_1/p15 The sources of the linkage (the agreements of 14.3.2018 and 23.3.2017, circular 5777/4) and the circular's purpose; the linked amounts are encoded below.

-- ¶16: the linkage is December 2017's index against December 2015's.
@ref akn:hc_1/p16
GIVEN `index of December 2017` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2015` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage factor` `index of December 2017` `index of December 2015` IS
    `index of December 2017` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2015`

DECLARE `group` IS ONE OF
    `teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform`
    `teachers outside the reform and principals`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `teaching employee` HAS
    `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in an upper division or grades 13-14` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employee group` IS A `group`

-- akn:hc_1/p17 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.

-- ¶18-¶19: upper divisions and grades 13-14, in the reform or outside it.
@ref akn:hc_1/p18 akn:hc_1/p19
GIVEN e IS A `teaching employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `rated in the teaching employees' grading`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution`
    AND e's `employed in an upper division or grades 13-14`

@desc A linked amount of the 2016 shekel supplement for a full position, per month, and the amount paid before it.
DECLARE `linked amount` HAS
    `linked from`      IS A DATE
    `linked to`        IS A DATE @desc 31.12.9999 where the circular gives no end
    `for group`        IS A `group`
    `amount linked`    IS A NUMBER
    `amount replaced`  IS A NUMBER @desc the amount paid for the period before this circular; 0 where none is named

-- ¶20-¶25. The circular gives the 1.6.2018 amounts no end date
-- (F-2017-18_tashach_05-a).
@ref akn:hc_1/p20 akn:hc_1/p21 akn:hc_1/p22 akn:hc_1/p23 akn:hc_1/p24 akn:hc_1/p25
`the linked amounts` MEANS
    LIST `linked amount` (Date 1 1 2018) (Date 31 5 2018)   `teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform`           834.29 832.62,
         `linked amount` (Date 1 1 2018) (Date 31 5 2018)   `teachers outside the reform and principals` 620.43 619.19,
         `linked amount` (Date 1 6 2018) (Date 31 12 9999) `teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform`           965.04 0,
         `linked amount` (Date 1 6 2018) (Date 31 12 9999) `teachers outside the reform and principals` 751.18 0

@ref akn:hc_1/p20 akn:hc_1/p23
GIVEN g IS A `group`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` g `the day` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `amount linked`)
             (filter (GIVEN a YIELD a's `for group` EQUALS g AND `the day` AT LEAST a's `linked from` AND `the day` AT MOST a's `linked to`)
                     `the linked amounts`))

-- ¶21-¶22: the difference owed for each month of 1.1.2018-31.5.2018 already paid.
@ref akn:hc_1/p21 akn:hc_1/p22
GIVEN g IS A `group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly difference owed for January-May 2018` g IS
    sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `amount linked` MINUS a's `amount replaced`)
             (filter (GIVEN a YIELD a's `for group` EQUALS g AND a's `amount replaced` GREATER THAN 0) `the linked amounts`))

-- akn:hc_1/p26 akn:hc_1/p27 A pointer to circular תשע"ז/4 for the supplement's other rules; no rule of its own.

DECLARE `linkage action` IS ONE OF
    `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` HAS `indemnity` IS A NUMBER

-- ¶28: the owners are indemnified at the relevant hour costs in the
-- payments system; no date is named.
@ref akn:hc_1/p28
GIVEN `indemnity due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `linkage action`
DECIDE `indemnifying the owners` `indemnity due` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `indemnity due`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

-- Findings.

-- F-2017-18_tashach_05-a: the 1.6.2018 amounts have no end, though the
-- agreement of 14.3.2018 (circular תשע"ח/3, not imported) steps the
-- supplement again on 1.12.2018; as encoded, the linked amount on
-- 1.1.2019 is still the 1.6.2018 figure.
`the linked amount the circular gives on 1.1.2019` MEANS
    `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform` (Date 1 1 2019)
`the 1.6.2018 amount runs on without an end` MEANS
    `the linked amount the circular gives on 1.1.2019` EQUALS 965.04
#ASSERT `the 1.6.2018 amount runs on without an end`

-- Examples. One linkage factor, 1.002 (the index ratio itself is not
-- printed), rounded to the agora, gives all four linked amounts from the
-- amounts of the agreement of 14.3.2018 for the same periods.
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS TRUNC (x PLUS 0.005) 2

`one factor reproduces every linked amount` MEANS
        `to the agora` (832.62 TIMES 1.002) EQUALS 834.29
    AND `to the agora` (619.19 TIMES 1.002) EQUALS 620.43
    AND `to the agora` (963.11 TIMES 1.002) EQUALS 965.04
    AND `to the agora` (749.68 TIMES 1.002) EQUALS 751.18
#ASSERT `one factor reproduces every linked amount`

#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `teachers outside the reform and principals` (Date 15 3 2018) EQUALS 620.43
#ASSERT `monthly difference owed for January-May 2018` `teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform` EQUALS 1.67
#ASSERT `the linkage factor` 102 100 EQUALS 1.02

#TRACE `indemnifying the owners` 1000 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` 1000 AT 1
